{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity has fallen before the machines. Now, a warrior equipped with special armor rises as the last hope to reclaim the lost world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intense Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master fast and fluid 2D side-scroller combat. Dodge, attack, and use special abilities to overcome relentless enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980920/extras/a0517abcbac98a90139bb8136620578b.poster.avif?t=1761797736\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980920/extras/a0517abcbac98a90139bb8136620578b.webm?t=1761797736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980920/extras/a0517abcbac98a90139bb8136620578b.mp4?t=1761797736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Colossal Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face giant enemies, each with unique attack patterns and electrifying battle phases. Prepare for challenges that will test your reflexes and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980920/extras/77b3ef6f85fda2967a6ba59d6441d66a.poster.avif?t=1761797736\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980920/extras/77b3ef6f85fda2967a6ba59d6441d66a.webm?t=1761797736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980920/extras/77b3ef6f85fda2967a6ba59d6441d66a.mp4?t=1761797736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore landscapes devastated by AIs: ruined cities, industrial factories, frozen complexes, and volcanic zones. Each stage brings new dangers and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980920/extras/c496cbbc5994524c5cecf67f4233a623.poster.avif?t=1761797736\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980920/extras/c496cbbc5994524c5cecf67f4233a623.webm?t=1761797736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980920/extras/c496cbbc5994524c5cecf67f4233a623.mp4?t=1761797736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The fate of humanity depends on you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take back the world from the machines?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3980920?t=1761797736","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980920/293a907ef5e5e01a0c79acf013adab669a3ac3aa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761797736","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980920/52fa208fb75f6c4be8831565c9b6c3f6af4737ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761797736","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980920/52fa208fb75f6c4be8831565c9b6c3f6af4737ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761797736","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_d